[
  {
    "start": 1.2,
    "duration": 7.48,
    "text": "Merry Christmas you filthy animals."
  },
  {
    "start": 3.76,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "And a happy new year. Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 16.72,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "Mandingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 25.0,
    "duration": 4.84,
    "text": "I guess I really don't know what"
  },
  {
    "start": 26.4,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "Christmas is all about."
  },
  {
    "start": 35.24,
    "duration": 5.56,
    "text": "Isn't there anyone who knows what"
  },
  {
    "start": 37.36,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "Christmas is all about?"
  },
  {
    "start": 47.12,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "Can I tell you what Christmas is all"
  },
  {
    "start": 48.76,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "about?"
  },
  {
    "start": 51.4,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "Chestnuts"
  },
  {
    "start": 57.24,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "Jack Frost nipping at your nose."
  },
  {
    "start": 63.12,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "So, I'm offering"
  },
  {
    "start": 70.48,
    "duration": 5.96,
    "text": "Happy Christmas Eve Mandingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 73.64,
    "duration": 5.84,
    "text": "And Bonnie lads is back. Me"
  },
  {
    "start": 76.44,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "and the little Mandingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 79.48,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "I"
  },
  {
    "start": 80.88,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "we're just out"
  },
  {
    "start": 82.12,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "local, me and Mick"
  },
  {
    "start": 85.52,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "for a Christmas camping special."
  },
  {
    "start": 87.92,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about"
  },
  {
    "start": 88.88,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "Mandingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 91.64,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "I saw Basically, I've just walked from"
  },
  {
    "start": 94.04,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "where I live"
  },
  {
    "start": 95.64,
    "duration": 5.64,
    "text": "over the fields."
  },
  {
    "start": 98.32,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "Hopefully we can get a good spot high up"
  },
  {
    "start": 101.28,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "looking down"
  },
  {
    "start": 102.52,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "onto the stunning city of Sunderland."
  },
  {
    "start": 105.12,
    "duration": 5.12,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 107.44,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "We've got some steaks to cook."
  },
  {
    "start": 110.24,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "We've got some camping meals"
  },
  {
    "start": 111.96,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "which were given to us"
  },
  {
    "start": 113.4,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "from Gary."
  },
  {
    "start": 114.64,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "Legend from Sunderland. You know who you"
  },
  {
    "start": 116.4,
    "duration": 1.88,
    "text": "are."
  },
  {
    "start": 117.48,
    "duration": 1.92,
    "text": "Cheers."
  },
  {
    "start": 118.28,
    "duration": 1.36,
    "text": "Give him the year, didn't he, Mick?"
  },
  {
    "start": 119.4,
    "duration": 2.04,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 119.64,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "He seen Mick standing on the street"
  },
  {
    "start": 121.44,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "corner,"
  },
  {
    "start": 122.56,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "recognized him,"
  },
  {
    "start": 124.68,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "give him some canned meals."
  },
  {
    "start": 126.4,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "We'll enjoy them tonight, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 128.0,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "Right, we will then."
  },
  {
    "start": 131.76,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "Yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 133.04,
    "duration": 4.36,
    "text": "We've got whiskey to drink"
  },
  {
    "start": 134.84,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "and do review."
  },
  {
    "start": 137.4,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "A drunk review cuz we've got"
  },
  {
    "start": 139.24,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "some cans of Budweiser. We've got some"
  },
  {
    "start": 140.72,
    "duration": 2.52,
    "text": "red wine."
  },
  {
    "start": 144.4,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Right, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 145.8,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "I'll see you as when we get up to our"
  },
  {
    "start": 146.88,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "spot."
  },
  {
    "start": 148.44,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "Hopefully we don't get moved on."
  },
  {
    "start": 237.56,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "So, I've come to this high point, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 240.2,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "But, um, we're going to go over to the"
  },
  {
    "start": 241.48,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "next hill. I'll show you."
  },
  {
    "start": 245.16,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "I think that one's a bit flatter on the"
  },
  {
    "start": 246.44,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "top for getting a good spot to pitch the"
  },
  {
    "start": 248.76,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "tent."
  },
  {
    "start": 250.08,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "There's nothing here,"
  },
  {
    "start": 253.28,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "which I knew before I came."
  },
  {
    "start": 258.16,
    "duration": 4.36,
    "text": "And with having the can there,"
  },
  {
    "start": 260.56,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "you get a lot of dog walkers that want"
  },
  {
    "start": 262.52,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "to come up to this point and then move"
  },
  {
    "start": 264.36,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "on."
  },
  {
    "start": 265.56,
    "duration": 2.4,
    "text": "That one over there,"
  },
  {
    "start": 267.12,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "although there's people out at the"
  },
  {
    "start": 267.96,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "minute,"
  },
  {
    "start": 269.84,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "it's not normally as busy as this one,"
  },
  {
    "start": 271.28,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "so"
  },
  {
    "start": 272.92,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "we're going to head over there."
  },
  {
    "start": 275.36,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "Hopefully them people's gone and we'll"
  },
  {
    "start": 276.92,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "get the tent set up."
  },
  {
    "start": 279.4,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "And then we might have a quick whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 281.16,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "What was up, Mick? What you reckon?"
  },
  {
    "start": 283.52,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "Whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 284.48,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "Whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 285.72,
    "duration": 5.24,
    "text": "Right."
  },
  {
    "start": 288.32,
    "duration": 2.64,
    "text": "Are you good looking?"
  },
  {
    "start": 299.6,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "Yes, Mick, lad."
  },
  {
    "start": 354.04,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "The little Mandingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 360.68,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "So, this is where we're pitching the"
  },
  {
    "start": 361.64,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "tent, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 363.04,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "Got the ground sheet down."
  },
  {
    "start": 365.48,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "Little Mick give it the seal of"
  },
  {
    "start": 366.52,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "approval. Happy with this spot, mate?"
  },
  {
    "start": 372.84,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "Should be looking down onto the big city"
  },
  {
    "start": 374.4,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "lights of Sunderland soon."
  },
  {
    "start": 376.4,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "I think we've got about half an hour,"
  },
  {
    "start": 377.4,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "Mick, and it'll be dark."
  },
  {
    "start": 383.04,
    "duration": 4.96,
    "text": "So, we're going to get move on."
  },
  {
    "start": 385.08,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Get this tent up."
  },
  {
    "start": 388.4,
    "duration": 5.4,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about,"
  },
  {
    "start": 389.28,
    "duration": 7.68,
    "text": "Mandingos. This is serious wild camping."
  },
  {
    "start": 393.8,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "In the city of Sunderland."
  },
  {
    "start": 421.4,
    "duration": 3.84,
    "text": "Right, folks. That's the tent set up."
  },
  {
    "start": 428.92,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "So, me"
  },
  {
    "start": 430.4,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "and the little Mandingo are going to get"
  },
  {
    "start": 432.16,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "in."
  },
  {
    "start": 433.2,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Get all our bits and pieces set up."
  },
  {
    "start": 437.72,
    "duration": 5.68,
    "text": "I love a little whiskey, eh, mate?"
  },
  {
    "start": 440.6,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "You better believe it."
  },
  {
    "start": 443.4,
    "duration": 2.96,
    "text": "Right, bring you back in a second, guys,"
  },
  {
    "start": 445.08,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "when we've getting all of our [\u00a0__\u00a0] set"
  },
  {
    "start": 446.36,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "up."
  },
  {
    "start": 452.0,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "There's little Mick nice and warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 454.08,
    "duration": 5.76,
    "text": "Got his new down jacket on."
  },
  {
    "start": 456.68,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "That'll keep you warm, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 460.64,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "Tent set up, guys. Give you a quick"
  },
  {
    "start": 462.28,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "text": "look."
  },
  {
    "start": 466.48,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "Got the food and everything down there."
  },
  {
    "start": 468.48,
    "duration": 4.52,
    "text": "Steaks and mushrooms. I'll show you"
  },
  {
    "start": 470.12,
    "duration": 2.88,
    "text": "properly later on."
  },
  {
    "start": 474.64,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "There's a little mix"
  },
  {
    "start": 476.12,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "sleeping bag there."
  },
  {
    "start": 478.44,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "Arm syrup."
  },
  {
    "start": 481.04,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "Mix got like a like a wide foil. It's"
  },
  {
    "start": 483.12,
    "duration": 5.04,
    "text": "not very long, which is ideal for him."
  },
  {
    "start": 485.76,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "It's nice and wide, so"
  },
  {
    "start": 488.16,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "we can even sit in the middle there."
  },
  {
    "start": 489.32,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "Keep all of our boards warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 496.28,
    "duration": 2.8,
    "text": "We're sorted, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 503.92,
    "duration": 5.04,
    "text": "And this will be our view tonight."
  },
  {
    "start": 506.2,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "Pretty cool, eh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 514.28,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "We'll sit out here till we're freezing"
  },
  {
    "start": 515.76,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "and we can't take any more."
  },
  {
    "start": 534.76,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "Right, Mick."
  },
  {
    "start": 536.68,
    "duration": 5.52,
    "text": "Lights."
  },
  {
    "start": 538.76,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "A merry white Christmas."
  },
  {
    "start": 620.36,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "Time for a snack, Mick."
  },
  {
    "start": 624.76,
    "duration": 6.56,
    "text": "Thanks to our mate, Gary. The mug 'em"
  },
  {
    "start": 627.88,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "IP A ales."
  },
  {
    "start": 636.68,
    "duration": 6.56,
    "text": "We will be eating this."
  },
  {
    "start": 639.92,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "We've got the hot water in there."
  },
  {
    "start": 649.24,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "Steak and veg is bubbling away,"
  },
  {
    "start": 650.68,
    "duration": 2.68,
    "text": "Mandingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 654.36,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "What have you got to say about that,"
  },
  {
    "start": 655.56,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "Mick?"
  },
  {
    "start": 657.36,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "It's going to be a lovely jubbly."
  },
  {
    "start": 659.96,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "Cheers, Gary, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 662.04,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "Cheers for the meal."
  },
  {
    "start": 664.76,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "So, guys, that's our first meal for the"
  },
  {
    "start": 666.6,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "night."
  },
  {
    "start": 668.2,
    "duration": 3.16,
    "text": "We've halved it. We had two packets"
  },
  {
    "start": 669.6,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "here. We're having half each."
  },
  {
    "start": 671.36,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "Pasta bolognese"
  },
  {
    "start": 673.08,
    "duration": 3.88,
    "text": "and beef and vegetables."
  },
  {
    "start": 675.56,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "Looks nice, doesn't it, Mick?"
  },
  {
    "start": 676.96,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "text": "Lovely."
  },
  {
    "start": 678.28,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "Lovely."
  },
  {
    "start": 678.76,
    "duration": 6.84,
    "text": "Nice hot meal in a freezing cold tent."
  },
  {
    "start": 682.0,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "You know what me and Mick's on about."
  },
  {
    "start": 687.76,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "Time for a nice glass of red wine,"
  },
  {
    "start": 689.28,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "Mandingos."
  },
  {
    "start": 691.84,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "We were going to keep this to go with"
  },
  {
    "start": 693.08,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "steak, but we'll have a little glass now"
  },
  {
    "start": 695.28,
    "duration": 4.88,
    "text": "and we'll keep a glass for our our nice"
  },
  {
    "start": 697.28,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "steak meal. We've got steak,"
  },
  {
    "start": 700.16,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "big mushrooms,"
  },
  {
    "start": 702.04,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "cherry tomatoes, and some new potatoes."
  },
  {
    "start": 704.24,
    "duration": 1.8,
    "text": "That's going to go down well, isn't it,"
  },
  {
    "start": 705.4,
    "duration": 1.44,
    "text": "Mandingo?"
  },
  {
    "start": 706.04,
    "duration": 4.48,
    "text": "Lovely, that."
  },
  {
    "start": 706.84,
    "duration": 3.68,
    "text": "Right, is it? Anyway,"
  },
  {
    "start": 710.64,
    "duration": 4.16,
    "text": "it's not an expensive bottle, fiver"
  },
  {
    "start": 712.8,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "Aldi's. You know what I'm talking about,"
  },
  {
    "start": 714.8,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "Mandingoes."
  },
  {
    "start": 716.16,
    "duration": 5.8,
    "text": "South African red wine, that'll do for"
  },
  {
    "start": 718.16,
    "duration": 3.8,
    "text": "me and the Is he little Mandingo?"
  },
  {
    "start": 722.72,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "Get that in the glass there, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 725.08,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "In the glass. In the paper cup, I should"
  },
  {
    "start": 727.04,
    "duration": 2.36,
    "text": "say."
  },
  {
    "start": 735.0,
    "duration": 4.44,
    "text": "Oh, yes."
  },
  {
    "start": 737.36,
    "duration": 4.28,
    "text": "There you go, Schmicker Rooney."
  },
  {
    "start": 739.44,
    "duration": 2.2,
    "text": "Cheers."
  },
  {
    "start": 742.04,
    "duration": 4.64,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": 743.96,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "Cheers, Mandingo."
  },
  {
    "start": 746.68,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "And cheers to you, Mandingoes. Or should"
  },
  {
    "start": 748.88,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "I say it, our Fandangoes."
  },
  {
    "start": 751.44,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "Fandangoes."
  },
  {
    "start": 752.52,
    "duration": 3.28,
    "text": "Chris here,"
  },
  {
    "start": 753.92,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "you know, he made that comment on one of"
  },
  {
    "start": 755.8,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "our on the video we've done recently. He"
  },
  {
    "start": 758.24,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "left a comment"
  },
  {
    "start": 759.52,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "saying Fandangoes."
  },
  {
    "start": 761.48,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "And he said he's going to copyright"
  },
  {
    "start": 762.72,
    "duration": 2.32,
    "text": "that, that's his saying. Well, I've"
  },
  {
    "start": 764.24,
    "duration": 1.2,
    "text": "pinched it off him."
  },
  {
    "start": 765.04,
    "duration": 3.64,
    "text": "you cheeky git."
  },
  {
    "start": 765.44,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "I've pinched that off you, Chris."
  },
  {
    "start": 771.32,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "Oh."
  },
  {
    "start": 772.4,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "It's all right, that."
  },
  {
    "start": 778.32,
    "duration": 3.92,
    "text": "Just like to say a thank you to everyone"
