  {
    "start": 1331.08,
    "duration": 4.92,
    "text": "when our bellies is full."
  },
  {
    "start": 1333.6,
    "duration": 5.96,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about."
  },
  {
    "start": 1336.0,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "This is serious wild camping."
  },
  {
    "start": 1342.08,
    "duration": 4.2,
    "text": "Right, guys. That's me and Mick sorted"
  },
  {
    "start": 1343.8,
    "duration": 4.72,
    "text": "for the night. We've had a good drink."
  },
  {
    "start": 1346.28,
    "duration": 4.8,
    "text": "Our bellies is full."
  },
  {
    "start": 1348.52,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "Mick's all snug as a bug there, nice and"
  },
  {
    "start": 1351.08,
    "duration": 1.56,
    "text": "warm, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 1351.72,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Nice and warm."
  },
  {
    "start": 1352.64,
    "duration": 4.24,
    "text": "Got his down jacket on, wrapped up in"
  },
  {
    "start": 1354.76,
    "duration": 4.56,
    "text": "his sleeping bag like a little sausage"
  },
  {
    "start": 1356.88,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "text": "roll."
  },
  {
    "start": 1359.52,
    "duration": 4.4,
    "text": "I'm going to get in my sleeping bag now,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1361.8,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "watch a movie."
  },
  {
    "start": 1363.92,
    "duration": 3.56,
    "text": "Just sit and relax. So, I'm going to put"
  },
  {
    "start": 1365.32,
    "duration": 4.68,
    "text": "the camera down."
  },
  {
    "start": 1367.48,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "I'm just going to drift off while I"
  },
  {
    "start": 1370.0,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "watch a movie."
  },
  {
    "start": 1371.6,
    "duration": 5.92,
    "text": "I will see you mandingos in the morning."
  },
  {
    "start": 1374.04,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "You know what Mick's talking about."
  },
  {
    "start": 1394.24,
    "duration": 5.36,
    "text": "Good morning, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1396.4,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "8:30 in the morning."
  },
  {
    "start": 1400.72,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "And it's as foggy as hell."
  },
  {
    "start": 1407.44,
    "duration": 3.24,
    "text": "Them nice views we had yesterday, clear"
  },
  {
    "start": 1409.44,
    "duration": 4.84,
    "text": "sky."
  },
  {
    "start": 1410.68,
    "duration": 3.6,
    "text": "Down under the city is totally gone."
  },
  {
    "start": 1417.2,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "It's not raining or anything."
  },
  {
    "start": 1419.12,
    "duration": 4.04,
    "text": "But it's wet."
  },
  {
    "start": 1420.4,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "Proper damp."
  },
  {
    "start": 1423.52,
    "duration": 4.84,
    "text": "Little bit chilly during the night."
  },
  {
    "start": 1426.44,
    "duration": 5.28,
    "text": "But not too bad."
  },
  {
    "start": 1428.36,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "I've had it a lot worse before."
  },
  {
    "start": 1432.32,
    "duration": 4.6,
    "text": "I wasn't bothered little Mick. He's"
  },
  {
    "start": 1433.88,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "still sound asleep."
  },
  {
    "start": 1437.52,
    "duration": 3.52,
    "text": "The little [\u00a0__\u00a0] was snoring all through"
  },
  {
    "start": 1439.0,
    "duration": 5.24,
    "text": "the night."
  },
  {
    "start": 1441.04,
    "duration": 3.2,
    "text": "So, he's definitely slept well."
  },
  {
    "start": 1444.88,
    "duration": 2.76,
    "text": "It was tremendous."
  },
  {
    "start": 1446.48,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "Once again,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1447.64,
    "duration": 2.84,
    "text": "absolutely loved it."
  },
  {
    "start": 1451.44,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "When we're finished the drink,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1453.88,
    "duration": 3.08,
    "text": "we were dying for some more cans or some"
  },
  {
    "start": 1455.44,
    "duration": 4.12,
    "text": "more whiskey."
  },
  {
    "start": 1456.96,
    "duration": 5.6,
    "text": "But I'm glad now we didn't cuz"
  },
  {
    "start": 1459.56,
    "duration": 3.0,
    "text": "feel proper fresh."
  },
  {
    "start": 1464.24,
    "duration": 3.04,
    "text": "Just glad I'm not rough."
  },
  {
    "start": 1467.72,
    "duration": 3.44,
    "text": "Anyway, guys,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1470.04,
    "duration": 3.72,
    "text": "I need to I should really show you"
  },
  {
    "start": 1471.16,
    "duration": 2.6,
    "text": "inside there."
  },
  {
    "start": 1478.56,
    "duration": 3.4,
    "text": "As we're going to have to pack up soon."
  },
  {
    "start": 1482.24,
    "duration": 3.36,
    "text": "Hey, we schmick."
  },
  {
    "start": 1484.76,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "All right, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 1485.6,
    "duration": 2.08,
    "text": "Hey."
  },
  {
    "start": 1488.32,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "Start and pack up soon, eh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1489.68,
    "duration": 2.12,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1492.64,
    "duration": 2.28,
    "text": "Go to McDonald's, eh?"
  },
  {
    "start": 1493.88,
    "duration": 2.48,
    "text": "All right."
  },
  {
    "start": 1494.92,
    "duration": 4.76,
    "text": "Get Get"
  },
  {
    "start": 1496.36,
    "duration": 6.44,
    "text": "hot coffee and some breakfast."
  },
  {
    "start": 1499.68,
    "duration": 3.12,
    "text": "I'll shut this door, mate."
  },
  {
    "start": 1507.92,
    "duration": 2.44,
    "text": "Anyway,"
  },
  {
    "start": 1510.8,
    "duration": 3.32,
    "text": "we're going to pack our stuff up now."
  },
  {
    "start": 1514.64,
    "duration": 5.92,
    "text": "And then we're going to go."
  },
  {
    "start": 1517.08,
    "duration": 3.48,
    "text": "So, that's the end of this video, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1523.28,
    "duration": 2.92,
    "text": "Have a great Christmas."
  },
  {
    "start": 1526.24,
    "duration": 4.32,
    "text": "Have a fantastic new year."
  },
  {
    "start": 1528.04,
    "duration": 4.08,
    "text": "Don't drink too much."
  },
  {
    "start": 1530.56,
    "duration": 3.76,
    "text": "And I'll see you in the next video. I'll"
  },
  {
    "start": 1532.12,
    "duration": 6.04,
    "text": "be out with the two Chrises"
  },
  {
    "start": 1534.32,
    "duration": 5.56,
    "text": "in a few days over the Lake District."
  },
  {
    "start": 1538.16,
    "duration": 4.0,
    "text": "You know what I'm talking about, guys."
  },
  {
    "start": 1539.88,
    "duration": 5.0,
    "text": "See you next time."
  },
  {
    "start": 1542.16,
    "duration": 2.72,
    "text": "Right."
  }
]